window.products.push({"id":1161099,"name":"Meeting New Friends by William Vanderdasson, 24x32-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gwpmGDH3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a cow playing with a pig in the center of the frame. William Vanderdasson has had an extraordinary career. In the last 30 years, William has become a popular illustrator, especially in the world of Sports Art. His renditions of golf games and car races are widely sought after, and have become part of international collections. A versatile artist, William has painted scenic landscapes, wildlife and sport images. His illustrations have been used on greeting cards, wrapping paper, and multiple other products with great success. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gwpmGDH3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07D778F9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D778F9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D778F9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
