window.products.push({"id":1161130,"name":"Nubee 3528cw 16.4ft 5M Non-Waterproof Flexible Strip 300LEDs Warm White LED Light Strip Kit + 12V 4A Power Supply","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41w6EB7NwEL.jpg","description":"Designed for the average home owner as well as lighting professionals, these flexible LED strips can be used for architectural lighting, sign letter lighting, concealed lighting, perimeter lighting amongst many other applications. They are a cool and efficient way to decorate tables, TV rooms, display cases, and closets. They can also function as eye catching special effects at stores and expo booths Features- Easy installation - Double side tape on back of strip sticks well to clean, flat, non-porous surface. Plug and play without wiring. R- Safe to use. The working voltage is 12V. extremely low heat. It is touchable and safe to children. R- Cut table and linkable. Easy to cut and use, it can be cut every 3 LEDs along the cutting marks, without damaging the rest strips. R- Flexible operations. Slim, compact and flexible PCB strip. Mount end-to-end for bendable or angled patterns, or in continuous rows. R- Reduce re-lamp frequency. Lifespan is over 50000 hrs. Save effort and maintenance costs on changing lights frequently. Eco-friendly. RoHS compliant. No battery. No lead or mercury. No UV or IR Radiation Specifications- LED Quantity/Type: 300 x SMD3528r- Color: Warm Whiter- Power Adapter: 12V 4A 48W Power Adapter(UL Approved)r- Protection class: IP30 (Non-Waterproof)r- Operating voltage: 12V DC- LED quantity: 60LED/Meter, 300 LED / 5 Meter(16.4 feet)r- Life time:50,000 hours Package Include:r1 X Nubee Warm White Non-waterproof 3528 SMD 300 LEDs LED Light Stripr1 X 12V 4A 48W LED Power Supply Accessories optional (not included)remote controller for dimmable feature. If you interested, please search \"nubee led dimmer\" on Amazon How to install Please search \"nubee led strip light\" on YouTube.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41w6EB7NwEL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nubee","source_asin":"B00L6SUM9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L6SUM9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L6SUM9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
