window.products.push({"id":1161295,"name":"Bed Skirt Queen Size and King Size, White Bed Skirt Adjustable Elastic Belt - 18 Inch Drop Easy to Put On, Wrap Around Ruffled Bed Skirt, Queen Size a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z54uajeRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elastic Wrap Around Bed Skirt Pure Ruffled Bed Skirts with Pins,14/16/18 Inch Drop We have focused on home textiles in design and manufacturing for many years. And the bed skirts are manufactured by our own factory and each process is strictly controlled. And we are very proud fo the quality of our products. Features: 1.Soft,comfortable and breathable fabric;Available size:Twin/Full, Queen/King with 16 inches, 18 inches drop.2.Adjustable elastic bed skirt with beautiful ruffles detailing.3.Hassle free yet easy installation.Just only need to spend few seconds in puting on and off.Easier than traditional bed skirt4.No need to lift the heavy mattress and just simple wrap it around your bed to ensure everything under your bed stays hidden..5.Come with coiled pins to keep it in place and make the bed hang beautifully and neat.6.Excellent sewing tecnology and fine workmanship make the bed skirt durable even after repeated washings.7. Suitable for most types of beds: conceals any frames, box springs, platforms, mattresses or underneath storage (But not suitable for beds with footboard or posts)Bed skirt pins is kindly suggested to use, especially after long term use the elastic belts may get loose.Also works great on adjustable beds too. Easy Care: Machine wash cold;Do not bleach.Tips:You can wash the bed skirt and steam it (steam iron set on low temperature ) before using and then it will look great.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71z54uajeRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TSUTOMI","source_asin":"B08KR32132","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KR32132","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KR32132","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1161296,"name":"NASA Apollo 11 Moon Landing 50th Canvas Tote Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aFwHliH7L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Pop Threads Graphic 100% cotton canvas tote bags are medium size and measure 15x15 inches with an 11-inch handle drop. The 20+ pound weight capacity lets these cotton shopping totes do double duty as sturdy cloth grocery bags. The style of the print is an intentional slightly distressed look. There are so many good reasons to reach for a modern cotton tote bag or reusable food shopping tote, but these cool prints make each soft canvas tote bag fun to use too.This canvas tote bag is the perfect replacement for plastic shopping bags. It's made of a heavyweight cotton canvas and is reinforced with double strips of stitching on the handles. The larger bottom makes it easy to fit all your goodies, and the natural color allows it to go with any outfit. Do your eco-friendly part by using these reusable bags.This high-quality item is proudly created and produced in the United States of America!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aFwHliH7L._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pop Threads","source_asin":"B0BXMH86KG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXMH86KG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXMH86KG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
