window.products.push({"id":1161393,"name":"Alarm Clock, Digital Clock with Large and Clear LED Display, Dimmable, Dual Alarm, Simple to Set, 3 Alarm Tone, 3-Level Volume, Compact and Stable Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+lKYV900L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Adapter not Included】This desk clock for bedroom only comes with a USB cable, does not equip with the adapter to plug into an outlet. Please buy carefully if you mind. 【High-Resolution】With its large screen (5.75in long and 3.03in wide), this desk alarm clock for bedrooms offers excellent visibility. The white digits take up the entire screen and are easy to read against a black background, so you can see them from a distance even without contacts or eyeglasses. 【Dimmable】A persistent, noticeable bright light can be a detriment to falling asleep. We highly recommend this desk clock for bedroom with the option of manually dimming the LED display. You can also choose to turn the screen off at night - an excellent feature if you like your room pitch-black. 【Dual Alarm】Considering you may have different needs for the alarm, the upgraded dual alarm clock provides two sets of alarms - One for you and the other for your spouse without affecting each other. And it supports a snooze function that gives you an extra 9-minute sleep after your original alarm. 【Optional Alarm Tone and Volume】The ideal alarm will wake you up without creating a jarring effect. This desk clock digital with 3 alarm tones (Chord Ringtone/Buzzer/Birdsong) and the option to change them based on personal preference. You also can choose the ringtone volume(75~85dB) from 3 levels. 【Extra Features】This desk clock is 12 or 24-hour display optional. What's unexpected is that this desk alarm clock can save time and alarm settings during a power outage. When the power is turned back on, it does not have to be reset, saving your time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+lKYV900L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prixster","source_asin":"B09Q8D1NKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q8D1NKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q8D1NKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1161394,"name":"Hawaiian Quilt Pillow Covers/Cushions, 100% Hand Quilted/Hand Appliqued 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1S1rgqnV0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These are brand new, 100% HAND QUILTED and HAND APPLIQUED NOT A MACHINE EMBROIDERED. These 2 pillow covers are made of 35% cotton and 65% polyester. We found this combination to be the best for durability and texture. We hand washed our quilts three times to ensure material integrity. Excellent addition to your bedroom or living room. It can also be framed beautifully. Add some Hawaiian style and bring Aloha to your home or office and also it makes a terrific gift for any special occasion! We use the traditional world famous Hawaiian quilting stitch/applique method. ** ALL SALES FINAL **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1S1rgqnV0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hawaiian Quilt Wholesale","source_asin":"B00DDILH3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DDILH3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DDILH3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
