window.products.push({"id":1161428,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Fashion Bed Group S-Cape 2.0 Adjustable Bed Base with WallHugger Technology and Full Body Massage, Twin/X-Large, Charcoal Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nqu-4NF4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We watch TV, read, play video games and work from the comfort of our beds. It’s the oasis after a long workday, where we seek a tranquil environment that inspires relaxation and rejuvenation. S-Cape 2.0 will cater to these needs, while providing innovative features to help promote a healthy posture during sleep with the user’s comfort in mind. This adjustable base has a 4” low-profile design with a contemporary, charcoal gray patterned fabric. The heavy-duty 2.5” diameter legs are adjustable from 6” to 10” in height so that you’ll always have the perfect fit. A patented MicroHook retention system holds the mattress in place so that you can eliminate the need for a metal mattress retainer bar and the foot of your base. A newly designed, back-lit wireless remote provides the user full control to relieve pressure points with weightless Zero Gravity or find personalized comfort by storing (2) of your favorite positions. Other functions include full-body dual massage with wave motion, and Snore button that quickly elevates the heard of the base 7” to open up airways. These body angle adjustments can potentially help ease stress, reduce soreness in the body, and moderate or eliminate snoring, allowing you to receive the highest level of personal comfort and the sleep you need. While other adjustable bed bases lift your upper body away from the wall, the S-Cape 2.0’s Wallhugger engineering lifts you up, while simultaneously gliding you back so that your nightstand and free standing remote are always within reach. Under the bed you’ll find lighting to provide ambience and functionality, and a high-performance motor with lift capacity of up to 850-lbs. A flat button can also be programmed for safety and convenience, and in the event that electricity is lost, the emergency power-down feature will slowly lower the base. The S-Cape 2.0 Adjustable Base comes with a 1-year full product, 3-year parts and labor, and 25-year parts only warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nqu-4NF4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076BD2TLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BD2TLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BD2TLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
