window.products.push({"id":1161448,"name":"Palace Imports 100% Solid Wood Wardrobe/Armoire/Closet with 3 Sliding Louvered Doors, Java. 5 Shelves Included. Additional Large Shelves Sold Separate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":939.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n7u4I68IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A very large wardrobe that stores a lot on a small footprint! With the sliding doors, no precious extra space is needed to open them. Fully customizable, you have total control over the wardrobe’s configurations by changing its layout to fit your needs: up to three full shelves can be added, up to three small shelves can be removed and each removable shelf has three adjustable positions. You can choose from raised panel doors in Honey Pine or Mahogany colors or louver doors in Java color. The doors slide on two tracks and only one opening is available at a time. The wardrobe’s functionality is enhanced by the aesthetics of the all wood construction. 100% pine wood is beautiful, but to balance its knotty nature, wood veneer is used on large panels over solid wood boards. This gives it a silky smooth feel and a spot-free appeal. Available in three hand painted finishes it can match your interior or you can choose from other Palace Imports’ perfectly compatible furniture pieces. Overall Size: 52\"w x 72\"h x 22.5\"d Colors: Mahogany, Honey Pine, Java Color/Wood Samples: Actual color may vary. Wood samples mailed out for color matching upon request Compatible Shelf Model Numbers: 5682 (Mahogany), 5684 (Honey Pine), 5686 (Java) Paint: Lead-free polyurethane compliant with the U.S. Federal Hazardous Substances Act Construction: - Two solid wood cross ties and two bars at the top for extra stability - Three 4 mm (5/32\") plywood back panels nailed to frame creating robust structure - Top flush with side panels to allow combining unlimited number of wardrobes Number of Doors: 3 Door Type: Louver with bronze pulls Door Closing Mechanism: - Bottom-rolling sliding system with dual tracks and guides - Aluminum dual tracks - Ball-bearing bottom guides - Teflon top guides - Doors are sliding independently - Only one door opening is available at a time Configurations: - 1 large, 4 small shelves (standard) - Up to 3 additional large shelves can be added - Maximum 4 large and 4 small shelves - Bottom 3 large and small shelves are removable - Removable shelves can be adjusted up or down in 2.5 inch increments - 2- and 3-Sliding Door Wardrobes can be combined to create any wardrobe width Material: 100% Solid pine wood Wood Quality: Pine is kiln dried to prevent splitting and size distortion Compatibility: Other matching pieces are available in identical color and style from Palace Imports Assembly: Requires assembly Shipping: - Ships flat in three boxes - Factory boxes are packaged into additional double-wall carton boxes in USA for best protection Ecology: “Smart Wood” sustainable tree farms are the only source of all wood as required by Brazilian law Country of Origin: Brazil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n7u4I68IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palace Imports","source_asin":"B01LXWTD1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LXWTD1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LXWTD1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
