window.products.push({"id":1161506,"name":"YJHome Reusable Food Storage Bags Stand Up 15 Pack Plastic Silicone Bags (3 Reusable Gallon Bags & 6 Reusable Sandwich Bags & 6 Reusable Snack Bags), ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619eAqzC2zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀 FOOD GRADE MATERIAL & ECO-FRIENDLY --- YJHome Stand Up Reusable Storage Bags made of FDA grade PEVA material that is BPA, Chloride, and Lead free. Food Bags is safe for the environment and earth. You can store food safely and worry-free. Any question please feel free contact with us. 🍀 LEAK-PROOF & SEALING --- YJHome Reusable Food Bags the upgraded double zipper seal has better sealing performance, leak-proof and waterproof, and effectively prevents food from leaking. It can meet your daily needs and keep food fresh. It is very suitable for storing and carrying food out. It can be easily used by children and the elderly. 🍀 MULTI PURPOSE & LARGE STORAGE CAPACITY --- Compared with other food bag on the market, ours food bag packages have more large-size bags, bringing more storage space for your food, more practical. With 3 x Blue Large Reusable Gallon Bags(10*7.9*2inch); 6 x Green Reusable Sandwich Bags (8*6*2inch); 6 x Blue Reusable Snack Bags (5.2*8.7*2.1inch). Widely used in food, lunch, snacks, sandwich, fruits, vegetables, meal, frozen foods and babies food etc. 🍀 FREEZER SAFE --- YJHome Leakproof Reusable food storage bags usable temperature range: -25℃-50℃. These reusable storage bags are freezer safe. It can lock out freezer burn while keeping food fresh and full of taste, perfect for freezing meat, fish, chicken, fruits, and vegetables. But not suitable for dishwasher, microwave and oven! 🍀 EASY TO USE & CLEAN --- You can use cold or room temperature water to clean the food bags with the matching blue silicone brush, and put the reusable bags on the top of a cup or cup holder to air dry. (Note: Do not use hot water to clean, it will damage the reusable bag .) It can be easily used by children and the elderly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619eAqzC2zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YJHome","source_asin":"B08S3MFDW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161506","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S3MFDW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S3MFDW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
