window.products.push({"id":1161636,"name":"Electric Spin Scrubber, Syvio Cordless Cleaning Brush 2X Stronger Power Motor with 4 Replaceable Brush Heads, Ergonomic D-Handle, Extendable Arm, Powe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q7ltZS6SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝Powerful, Efficiency & 140 Mins Continuous Work--More powerful than others in its market, Syvio electric spin scrubber comes with up to 4000mAh, 300/350 RPM Dual Optional Spinning Speeds, which help you clean more efficiently without any stuck. This shower scrubber is equipped with 2 Batteries(1 more battery than others), which work continuously up to 140 mins after one charging. Ideal for cleaning your bathroom, tub, floor, car, grooves, toilet, glass, grout, etc! 💝Extendable Arm & 3 Adjustable Angle--Syvio shower cleaning brush is equipped with an extendable stainless-steel rod and 3 adjustable angles, needn't kneel or bend over anymore. The handle extends from 24 inches to 42 inches, it has 5 scales for adjustment, you can also remove the rod and connect the D-shaped handle, working as different brushes to save the cost of purchasing other tools. The brush head angle can be adjusted 45°, 90°, 180°, so you can clean without dead ends. 💝4 Brushes to Meet All Scenes--Syvio floor scrubber comes with 4 brushes for almost all scenes. The Round Brush is perfect for bathtubs, sinks, baseboards, toilet; The flat brush for large surfaces, like floors, pools, tiles, and glass; The pointed brush is for that with gaps, like corner, shower, car tires, faucets, crevices; The Cloth Brush is perfect for fragile delicate surface, like Car boby and windows. All the brushes are Anti-shedding and won’t scratch surfaces. 💝IPX7 Waterproof & Safe Cleaning Tips--More advanced than others, the head of this electric cleaning brush is certified with IPX7 waterproof, never worry that the machine head will be broken, and it can resists splashes. For better deep cleaning, before using the power brush, please spray the cleaner on the stain. Please remove the brush head separately to clean. 💝Ideal Gift for Your Family & Hassle Free--Syvio electric scrubber is easy to use and powerful, it can help you do the housework with the most relaxed posture, getting rid of sore arms, sore knees, sore backs, or arthritis. It is an ideal gift for your beloved family, parents, and friends. SYVIO provides 30-Day Return & 1-Year 100% Customer Satisfaction Service!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q7ltZS6SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"syvio","source_asin":"B0BC997ZYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC997ZYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC997ZYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
