window.products.push({"id":1161673,"name":"Neighbourhood Home King Size Giza Set Sheet - Soft Breathable Giza Egyptian Cotton Sheet Set in 4-Piece, 16-Inches Extra Deep Pockets Fitted Sheet, Sa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150z-KvcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 PIECE GIZA EGYPTIAN KING Sheet Set Includes: 1 Flat Sheet 102\" Wide x 108\" Long, 1 Fitted Sheet 78\" Wide x 80\" Long Fits 16-Inch Deep Pockets, and 2 Pillowcases 20\" Wide x 40\" Long. Comes in many attractive colors to suit your bedroom décor. Fully elasticized fitted Sheets with 16 Inch deep pockets are generously sized to fit deep and pillow-top mattresses. GOOD NIGHT SLEEP - This Egyptian Giza cotton set has a cool, crisp and ultrafine feel with a contemporary matte finish. Warmer sleepers can rest assured, as this range is ideal for keeping temperatures down and regulated, given its lightweight and breathable quality. Achieve deeper sleeps and brighter mornings. 100% EGYPTIAN GIZA COTTON SHEETS - Pure Egyptian Giza cotton is one of the finest grades of cotton in the world. Grown in the Nile Delta region, it is hand-picked and rolled in cotton gins to prevent damage to the fibres. The best Egyptian cotton is made from long and extra-long staple fibres which are more durable and stronger than short staple cottons. TOP QUALITY – The product is made with High Quality Fabric, hence they are fade, shrink and wrinkle resistant. They may shrink and wrinkle a bit as they are made from pure cotton. You will witness the sheet set getting softer and glowing with every wash. Customer Satisfaction is our prime goal and we take every feedback very seriosly. Having any issue with the product, contact us and we will make sure you get the best solution possible. WASHING CARE - Separate like colors, whites, and dark colors and make sure to only wash one unfolded bedding set at a time. Overfilling your washer will not allow your bedding to be evenly washed. Use cold water with a mild, liquid detergent to wash your sheets. Avoid fabric softeners and harsh detergents as these may weaken fibers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150z-KvcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neighbourhood Home","source_asin":"B093XWSR41","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093XWSR41","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093XWSR41","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
