window.products.push({"id":1161791,"name":"Stainless Steel Drink Muddler - Make Flavorful Cocktails with Ease!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yMkUofGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are You Falling Prey To These 3 Critical Mistakes Mixologists Are Making When Muddling Cocktails? - Over muddling herbs causing them to release a bitter taste in your Mojito - Under muddling fruits resulting in a lack of flavors in your cocktail - Transferring flavors between cocktails when mixing drinks Creating exquisite cocktails requires not only the right ingredients but the right tools as well. Professional bartenders will tell you that the muddler is one of their most indispensable tools. The Mojito, Mint Julep, old Fashioned and Capipiroska all require muddling to make them taste fabulous! This \"muddling\" of the ingredients brings forth a burst of flavor when the alcohol is poured into the glass over the mixture. Traditional muddlers are made out of lacquered wood, which over time becomes difficult to clean and can lead to polluting your drinks. This new modern version is made of stainless steel which will remain beautiful and never add unwanted tastes to your drinks. It has a grooved nylon head for through mashing (muddling) of ingredients. A well-stocked bar includes fine liquor and all the bartender's tools, so don't forget your toba muddler. It may well inspire you to open up a cocktail book and try a new drink. So why choose Arctic Chill? Here's the benefits... -Grooved head designed to finely mash citrus fruits, herbs and spices! -10\" body allows you to muddle citrus fruits, herbs & other ingredients directly in the shaker without scraping your hand on the side. -Stainless steel body with polypropylene head! -Dishwasher safe (hand washing recommended)! Satisfaction Guaranteed! To ensure your complete satisfaction we also back our product with a 30 day replacement guarantee! Be ready for your next cocktail party and order your toba muddler today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yMkUofGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ToBa","source_asin":"B01AXHXT6Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AXHXT6Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AXHXT6Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
