window.products.push({"id":1161846,"name":"Mofado Weighted Stemless Crystal Wine Glasses - 15oz (Set of 4) - Thick, Stable, Heavy Hand Blown Crystal - For Red and White Wine - Beautiful Gift fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j8u-b-kLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ULTRA-CLEAR CRYSTAL GLASS - Each premium stemless wine glass is hand-blown from the finest ultra-clear crystalline lead-free glass. Crystal glass is what gives the exceptional brilliance, clarity and sparkle to our wine glasses. Generic wine glasses are machine made of regular glass and look cheap, dull and utilitarian. ✅EXCEPTIONAL QUALITY AND ELEGANCE - These crystal stemless wine glasses are substantially more solid than generic glasses. The weighted bottom makes them ultra stable. The dimpled weighted base has just the right thickness for reflections and refractions of light to create a look of timeless classic elegance! ✅PROVEN MOFADO QUALITY + PREMIUM VALUE - Mofado products are distinguished by premium quality and craftsmanship and we have over 9500 reviews and ratings across our product range. Our skilled craftsmen have years of experience making crystal glassware. Buy with confidence! ✅PERFECT GIFT - Send a set of these beautiful glasses to a friend, family member or anyone else. Every time they sip their favorite red or white wine in these glasses, they will think of you! Make their day :) All Mofado wine glasses come in premium gift packaging making them an excellent gift for any occasion. These glasses are dishwasher safe although hand washing is recommended. ✅SATISFACTION/DELIVERY GUARANTEE - If you're not 100% satisfied with your wine glasses, contact us or return them within 30 days for a complete ‘hassle free’ refund. If by any chance your shipment arrives damaged, we will send you a replacement for free. ✅CUSTOMER REVIEW - \"Great glasses! These are sturdy glasses. One was dropped 2 feet off of an end table, and not a scratch. I don't drink wine, got these to be a good host. Whenever someone uses them, they always have a compliment. It seems I chose wisely. Highly recommend!\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j8u-b-kLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mofado","source_asin":"B086CXPC23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086CXPC23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086CXPC23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1161847,"name":"Avenco Twin Size Bed Mattress in a Box, 10 Inch Hybrid Spring and Gel Memory Foam Mattresses for Kids, Edge Support, Medium Firm, CertiPUR-US Certifie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zg6Q6VK-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reason to choose Avenco 10 Inch Original Series Hybrid Mattress 1. This twin mattress is a hybrid design for balance support and pressure relief, which includes 2 layers of comfort foam, 2cm gel memory foam, 1cm high-density foam, and a pocket spring system. With a multi-layer foam layer, you can enjoy a more restful night by reducing the pressure between this twin mattress and your body. 2. The benefit of a twin hybrid mattress is motion isolation. As each pocket spring works independently, it can effectively reduce the motion transfer between springs and reduce noise, you won’t be disturbed by turning over or getting up during the night. 3.This twin mattress has edge reinforcement, making it easier to get in and off and strengthening the edge support. 4. Avenco twin mattress memory foam is safe assured, all foam is CertiPUR-US certified, and safe for the human body. You can sleep safely on this twin mattress 10 inch. 5.This twin mattress is medium-firm feeling with body encountering foam, excellent resilience, and great support help to relieve your pressure. 6. This twin mattress in a box comes with a 10-year warranty and 100 nights trial, you can buy with confidence. 7. This 10 inch twin mattress for kids is compressed and rolled up in a box, you can transport take this mattress in a box. Kindly allow the 10 Inch hybrid mattress twin to expand at least 72 hours before sleep. 8. As a member of ISPA, we committed ourselves to offer an energetic morning to dreamers, you can embrace an ideal morning with the Avenco twin mattress. Package includes: 1X 10 Inch Avenco Hybrid Twin Mattress in a Box 1X package opener 1X user manual Unlike traditional spring mattress, this innerspring hybrid mattress twin size deserve your try. With medium-firm support, you can say goodbye to back pain and wake up fresh! Note: Due to the 3D breathable mesh fabric design, the surface of the mattress is designed with an arc shape, and the edge will be slightly lower than the interior. If the edges are not inflated, tap to aid recovery, it will take a while for the mattress to fully recover after compression, please be patient for at least a week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zg6Q6VK-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avenco","source_asin":"B0B4WV3MTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4WV3MTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4WV3MTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1161848,"name":"Iwax Citronella Candles Outdoor and Indoor Scented Candles Gift Set 3 Pack,13.5Oz Natural Soy Wax for Garden Patio Yard Home Balcony","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N0x+1lUqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Citronella Candles Outdoor and Indoor Please put the burning candle on the surface of heat-resistant place or put it on a thermal pad to avoid damage to furniture. This outdoor citronella candle is not only great for bedroom, living room, but it is also the perfect addition to yourcampfire, backyard patio party or an outdoor picnic with family. TIPS 1.The container of this lemongrass candle is a metal product. The candle will be hot when it is lit. Do not touch it when it is burning and within one hour after it is extinguished. 2.Please use it on the surface of heat-resistant furniture, or put it on a thermal pad to avoid damaging the furniture. 3.Don't burn candles out of sight. 4.Keep away from children, pets, and any flammable materials when the candle is burning. Package includes: 3x 13.5oz Citronella Candles","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N0x+1lUqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iwax","source_asin":"B08RD6NGZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RD6NGZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RD6NGZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
