window.products.push({"id":1161989,"name":"Ice Cube Tray with Lid and Box 165 - Ice Cube Mold for Refrigerator BPA Free Ice Container with Spoon and Lid Blue Green Powder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sE2YvSGVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WIDE RANGE of APPLICATION: each large tray can make 55 x 1x blue, 1x green, 1x pink can make mini ice cubes with different flavors, a total of 165 pieces (6ml each, 975ml for three trays). Mini ice cubes are widely used in life, perfect for cocktails, coffee and tea, baby food, perfect for protein shakes and smoothies, a must-have for family gatherings and RV trips! EASY TO HANDLE ICE CUBE TRAY: ice cubes made of food grade plastic are easier to take out than silicone ice cube molds, the surface is smooth without any preservatives, it can be easily released with just one twist, no need to wait until the ice starts to melt, No bottom tapping or running water required. The tray can be emptied as soon as it is taken out of the refrigerator. SIMPLE and CONVENIENT ICE CUBE TRAY: The ice tray lid and tray edge prevent water from spilling and are easier to handle than silicone ice trays. The even protrusions between each cube compartment allow water to flow into each other when poured, making ice cubes that stay in perfect chunks without sticking together, easy to carry and put in the fridge without worrying about water output. MULTI-LAYER STACKING ICE TRAY: The ice tray cover can stack more trays, the product includes: 3 x ice cube trays with lid, 1 x storage container, 1 x scoop. The stack measures 10.6(L) x 6.7(W) x 4.7(H) inches, making it ideal for RV refrigerators and home refrigerators. The lid is designed to fit better in the tray, preventing the ice cubes from absorbing frozen odors, keeping the ice cubes fresh and hygienic. Also allows stacking of multiple trays, saving a lot of space. Great for DIY creations STURDY and SAFA: Made of food grade material, Bpa free, no odor, no oil film floating, safe for your family! The 165 Mini Ice Cube Tray uses better materials and designs to make it stronger and more durable. Thick and elastic! They can withstand long-term low temperature storage without breaking! Start using them to enjoy your ice drink time。","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sE2YvSGVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SQLHM","source_asin":"B09XDXKXWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1161989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDXKXWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDXKXWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
